    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d416">

                <pb facs="0437" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg339"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum handed to Mr. Adee by Baron von Sternburg,
                        German Chargé d’Affaires.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >German Embassy</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Russian Government proposes to send an international detachment under a white
                    flag as far as the city walls of Pekin to effect a peaceful bringing back of the
                    foreign envoys now in Pekin.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
